                        "review": "What...  In the actual demented Hell...  IS THIS?!?!?!\n\nSure I am familiar with other works of these Developers and even yell at them to point incoherent sheet out, but this...  This was FAR WORSE than one could've even imagined!!!\n\nEverything is just WRONG.  The psychology of things...  OMG!!!  WHO ACTS LIKE THAT?  Who DOES THAT?  It's...  It's so bad it's almost...  Insanity!!!\n\nMC (as per usual) is terminally dumb, incredibly useless, intensely heavy drunk and this is all she does: CRYING x100 / Blushing x1000 / \"HUH?\" x100 and forces men to \"love her\", because she \"loves\" them.  Sure honey.  All you got going are your looks and your \"20 something year old body\".  But in actuality...  Her brain cells (which are all dead btw) are that of a less than a 13 year old.  (And that's rather offensive to youngins that age as well!!!) >.>\n\nShe also waits for everyone else to solve her problems and whines like there is no tomorrow.  When a guy is suffering, she ensures to say that \"he is thinking badly of me\" and will NEVER go after him to find out the problem.\n\nThe guys will *always* try to shut her up with sex.  Because that's all she has to offer and she just genuinely sucks!!!\n\nLove Interests...  Are all h*rny teenagers.  NONE (except MAYBE the GRANDPA) act like their age.  All they know is \"mine, run away and sex\".\n\nI am also going to be offended on Yakuza's behalf too.  Because this \"BOOK\" made them out to be \"lil bitter kids that fight over petty reasons\".  Are you...  SERIOUS?!?!\n\nSo this is what you'll get with every Love Interest:\n\nHodo -> She cries in every Chapter and the guy evades her, then comes back.\n\nGrandpa -> He isn't that bad, but his Route is dull af.\n\nRyu -> Actually, okay, but..!  The Psychology of [spoiler]stalkers[/spoiler] is so badly portrayed in this episode that it's just downright BS!!!\n\nLawyer -> MC doesn't give a damn if she dies or not as long as she gets properly used by the long haired man.\n\nCop -> Acts nothing like a cop in his Route and it's just constant evasion to the point of extreme boredom.  Enjoy even more crying and whining!!!\n\nAnd something that should've taken me less than 10hours to read, taken THIS much longer because I had to keep stopping and trying to see if I lost my DAMN mind READING WHATEVER THIS WAS!!!!!\n\nHorrendous.  Atrocious and...  You SEVERELLY Fawked up the OLDER GUYS!!!!!!!!!!!\n\nAs well as the bad guys...  Like seriously?  How deranged you gotta be?\n\nSigh.",
